			"Message": "style(Cocoon): Normalise config JS to tab indentation with trailing commas\n\nReformat all Configuration/ESBuild/*.js and Configuration/Mountain/Config.js from 2-space indentation back to tab indentation, matching the project's prevailing convention. Alongside the indentation change:\n\n- Reorder import/export declarations so re-exports appear after local imports, refining the convention established in the previous style pass.\n- Add trailing commas to all array and object literals across every config file.\n- Consolidate duplicate imports in Target.js (default3/default5 now share a single import from Config/Target/Config.js).\n- Flatten Environment Constant.js exports to a single-line block.\n- Re-wrap long function-call argument lists and template expressions at softer line widths (Compile Config.js, Mountain Config.js).\n\nRegenerate the RouteManifest timestamp (2026-05-20T08:08:59Z) and rebuild all Target/ compiled artifacts to reflect the reformatted configuration sources. No functional changes to build logic, RPC method registration (still 135 Mountain methods), or runtime behaviour.",
			"SHA": "1e273240b714bf8094b9aca371bcf702abc79aee"
